ISO-10303-21;
/* Pf003: forward-reference DATA section: ADVANCED_FACE/EDGE_LOOP topology emitted before EDGE_CURVE/VERTEX_POINT/CARTESIAN_POINT geometry; forces multi-pass resolver in single-threaded reader; the defect entity is emitted but sits unreachable from the shape-rep root (product chain roots a GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET stub), so OCC loads only a 1-vertex stub (shape(1)); byte-present but oracle-invisible to the load-time shape-count oracles */
